      "body": "Full year 2026 results: EPS: ₹2.20 (up from ₹0.68 loss in FY 2025). Revenue: ₹244.9m (up 318% from FY 2025). Net income: ₹56.2m (up ₹72.8m from FY 2025). Profit margin: 23% (up from net loss in FY 2025). The move to profitability was driven by higher revenue. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 41% per year but the company’s share price has increased by 119% per year, which means it is tracking significantly ahead of earnings growth.",
